{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026nLgoLdZROy1792671164.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>【璀璨之城】第九集精華 父子爭奪名利不顧親情 最終親兒一無所有</p><p></p><p>官志琛(姜大衛)表面上幫兩兄弟諗辦法解決危機，但事實上暗中諗辦法進入LKS董事局。當兄弟二人成功解決危機後，LKS突然宣佈一個令孝賢(張智霖)、孝君(吳卓羲)都感到震撼的消息。</p><p></p><p>璀璨之城｜星期一至五 晚上08:30 PM｜翡翠台</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T01:44:53.592035+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T01:11:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T20:18:20.772045+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T01:38:08.148343+00:00","content_hash":"c1ad35c11504cb1c54be37abdec8b6291e8ca07973f12fc3e18166537d82618e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T01:44:53.592035+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}